---
title: worktree-jumper CI Workflow
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant FB as Feature Branch
    participant M as master
    participant GH as GitHub Actions

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over FB,M: PR → master
        Dev->>FB: push changes
        FB->>M: open PR
        activate GH
        GH->>GH: install zsh + fish
        GH->>GH: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
        GH->>GH: typecheck
        GH->>GH: lint
        GH->>GH: test
        GH->>GH: build
        GH->>GH: test:e2e
        GH->>GH: license:verify
        deactivate GH
        GH-->>FB: checks pass
        Dev->>M: merge PR
    end

    rect rgb(224, 255, 230)
        Note over M,GH: Push → master (post-merge)
        activate GH
        GH->>GH: install zsh + fish
        GH->>GH: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
        GH->>GH: typecheck
        GH->>GH: lint
        GH->>GH: test
        GH->>GH: build
        GH->>GH: test:e2e
        GH->>GH: license:verify
        deactivate GH
    end
